UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" CampusIdentityLink : linked identities
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" AccountRole : permission assignments
Listing "1" -- "0..*" ContentReport : reported listing [logical ID]
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" ContentReport : reporter [logical ID]
ContentReport "1" -- "0..*" ModerationDecision : recorded outcomes
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" ModerationDecision : authorised moderator [logical ID]
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" NotificationPreference : channel preferences [logical ID]
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" NotificationDelivery : recipient [logical ID]
Benefit "1" -- "0..*" BenefitRedemption : versioned benefit
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" BenefitRedemption : redeeming user [logical ID]
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" Benefit : responsible manager [logical ID]
